{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd1866cf0a7bad192c0ac77f0a15bd90eff94862633926ed6744156f9d06b89b", "ja": "（映画の撮影も後半に入った。日を追うごとに\n主演の桃子とのり子も、調子がいいみたいだ）", "zh": "（电影拍摄已经进入后半段。主演桃子和法子似乎也一天比一天状态更好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "9436d7a458e02df6923bfc0c7d8bcccd50ea4e1e6978ca1c49faeb8a1c88778e", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様！\nどうだった、アタシたちの演技？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n觉得我们俩的演技怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1002_p", "source_sha256": "26012e537ed6aca7e3efc3f1556706e2464b7794a868d65068f6a906865ceec5", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様！　すごくよかったぞ。\n監督も「いい映画になりそう」って喜んでたよ。", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了！演得特别棒。\n导演也很高兴，说“看来会拍成一部不错的电影”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "72de8b1558bae4a93afb16a2068b7e55bed4c8b0deb61e50a19ee5a6ac1f9ac2", "ja": "桃子もそう思う。お話が面白いのもあるけど、\nなにより桃子たちが演じてるんだから。", "zh": "桃子也是这么想的。虽然故事本身很有意思，但最重要的是，这是桃子她们出演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3ea82ed993ae494d5a9979a29528851567917ec732fa1e0e10dcbe7e57d5cd33", "ja": "ああ。二人の熱の入った演技で納得の仕上がりだ。\nこれは公開が楽しみだな。", "zh": "啊。两人投入的演技让成品令人满意。\n真期待公开啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "afba6f9116b1d8af7e0710d5b7a9ccff2af578132e3918815863fae104a8cdb9", "ja": "うんうん！　まあ正直、アタシは桃子の演技に\n引っ張ってもらってるようなものなんだけど。", "zh": "嗯嗯！不过说实话，我基本都是被桃子的演技带着走的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "aebedf5556df4ebdd060eb9761db66461b10a11b51bec784b417a77c8e5624bf", "ja": "さっきの舞踏会のシーンなんて\n本当に、桃子の家庭教師になったみたいで……。", "zh": "刚才舞会的那场戏，我真的感觉自己就像成了桃子的家庭教师一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "1b5a0d2e045479c5a63a9a701d6a9fe2c941bf26ff73f5de5ba0c4b98cd2aeb7", "ja": "桃子のカーテシーを見たら、本気で、じーんと\nしちゃって……えへへ。ありがとね、桃子。", "zh": "看到桃子的屈膝礼后，我真的感动得不得了……嘿嘿。谢谢你，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "366203c10fd785a2fbe313557794390400332c700c91ea71d965bc4afd518b6f", "ja": "……ふふん、当然だよ。桃子はプロだもん、って\n言いたいけど。いい演技なのは、この役だからだよ。", "zh": "……哼哼，那是当然啦。桃子可是专业的嘛——\n虽然很想这么说。不过能演得好，也是因为这个角色啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ac2ac31ff75262ebb90ad5204e1ceaefeb7e7d92cf544c1ed3e9167f0b02ef0f", "ja": "この役だから……？", "zh": "是因为这个角色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "6240bf14d9aac259ec8073df339334224ce35ccc2847eaabdf6dfae71fda9fb2", "ja": "うん……。桃子も、同じだったから。\n周りの人を困らせちゃう気持ち……。", "zh": "嗯……因为桃子以前也是一样的。\n那种让周围的人为难的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "b065253d87369adfdf2c1d29d772d454ef7ef02bb62e3e22e79f127563f06ed6", "ja": "桃子……。", "zh": "桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "2febfe9eac3f22da6f74e268b536d1ec0c9234ae72b474a18f1b59a3b5af8a8c", "ja": "あ……えっと、だからね。桃子は経験があったから\nすごく演技がしやすかったなって思って……。", "zh": "啊……那个，所以说。因为桃子有过相关经验，我觉得演起来特别容易……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "a5c7a0e4e13afeb8a510847204ce82a9a17748ac4c518b94c4f05cb9ecfbfd56", "ja": "先生への感謝の気持ちとか、そういうのも全部。\n演技だけど……桃子の言葉として出てきたっていうか。", "zh": "对老师的感激之情什么的，也全都是。虽然是在演戏……但感觉就像是以桃子的口吻说出来的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "2829de04da21bd4f23e9b9ad224cbc8317280d9eaf03c8b91183edb596cec4d5", "ja": "やっぱりすごいね、桃子！　自分の経験を\nそうやって演技に活かせちゃうなんて、流石だよ！", "zh": "果然很厉害啊，桃子！居然能把自己的经历\n这样运用到演技里，真不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "64d477dccbd8a4ddea683ca36371819110e2ac4e1cb36d95010a47df758d6818", "ja": "え？　あ、ありがと。……でも、のり子さんだって、\nちゃんと感情移入できてるのはすごいと思うよ。", "zh": "诶？啊，谢谢。……不过，我也觉得能真正融入感情，典子姐也很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "179deaf690695bb76d2bfdab67173407bcd9b06467ca906704b98fb31e2d0e37", "ja": "桃子、のり子さんが先生だから\n素直になれたんだと思うし……。", "zh": "桃子觉得，正因为教桃子的是典子姐，桃子才能坦率起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a31e00b3f43884cb6972d9b6b9107936c91218601ec2a63ca9770271164816d", "ja": "ホント？　えへへ、よかった！\nそれじゃ、この調子で次の撮影もがんばろうね！", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，那就好！\n那么，就照这个势头为下一次拍摄也加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "2b9b7503c175641eed6e61329afcd477fe5051ace21c68c61bd4364ea8559a1b", "ja": "うん！　よろしくね……じゃなくて、\nよろしくお願いします、先生！", "zh": "嗯！接下来也请多多关照……不对，\n请多多关照，老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0544_1019_p", "source_sha256": "41600e1bb679596f8553c2df66b025ea4c2ce8e6aa36876d67b5dd6cf2075edc", "ja": "（桃子の演技力とのり子の情熱が、いい形で作用した\nみたいだ。クランクアップまで二人と突き進もう！）", "zh": "（桃子的演技力和纪子的热情，似乎以很好的形式发挥了作用。一起和她们两人努力到杀青吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
